### Address Forms
Make address entry accessible with proper labeling to ensure smooth delivery information collection.

**Accessibility Impact:** Address forms are complex but essential for e-commerce fulfillment. Screen reader users need clear field labeling and relationship understanding. International customers require flexible address formats. Autocomplete features must work with assistive technologies.

**Key Requirements:**
