## Compliance and Legal Protection

### WCAG 2.1 AA Success Criteria Mapping
Map implementation to specific WCAG criteria.

**Success Criteria Coverage:**
- **1.1.1** Non-text Content - Alt text implementation
- **1.3.1** Info and Relationships - Semantic HTML, ARIA
- **1.4.3** Contrast (Minimum) - Color contrast standards
- **2.1.1** Keyboard - Full keyboard accessibility
- **2.4.1** Bypass Blocks - Skip links
- **2.4.6** Headings and Labels - Proper heading hierarchy
- **3.2.2** On Input - No unexpected context changes
- **4.1.2** Name, Role, Value - Proper ARIA implementation

